  </div>
</div>

      <p class="max-w-xl leading-relaxed text-stone-800">
        Payment is due at the time of service. We accept:
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-4 font-semibold text-deeper-teal">
